c2patool C2PA cloud signing variant

This repository is derived from the open source c2patool project from the
Content Authenticity Initiative / C2PA Rust SDK project:

  https://github.com/contentauth/c2pa-rs
  https://github.com/contentauth/c2patool

Portions of the upstream project are copyright Adobe and other upstream
contributors, and are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, or the
